<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="section-1" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Factoring</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      In this section we will focus on factoring, mainly the factoring 
      of quadratic expressions. By the end of this section we will have 
      developed a general factoring strategy that can be applied to all
      quadratic expressions and can extend to higher power expressions
      as well. Factoring is one of the ways to solve a quadratic equation,
      which will be the focus of our next section.
    </p>
  </introduction>
